NetSurf libraries, used by tFire (tOS's web browser) for HTML parsing and CSS.

  libparserutils 0.2.5   https://source.netsurf-browser.org/libparserutils.git   MIT (libparserutils/COPYING)
  libwapcaplet   0.4.3   https://source.netsurf-browser.org/libwapcaplet.git     MIT (libwapcaplet/COPYING)
  libhubbub      0.3.8   https://source.netsurf-browser.org/libhubbub.git        MIT (libhubbub/COPYING)
  libcss         0.9.2   https://source.netsurf-browser.org/libcss.git           MIT (libcss/COPYING)

Taken from the release tarballs (download.netsurf-browser.org/libs/releases/). Only the library sources and public
headers are kept; tests, docs and build files are not.

Generated files that upstream makes at build time were made once with upstream's own generators and are kept here:
  libparserutils/src/charset/aliases.inc            (build/make-aliases.pl)
  libhubbub/src/tokeniser/entities.inc              (build/make-entities.pl)
  libcss/src/parse/properties/autogenerated_*.c     (src/parse/properties/css_property_parser_gen.c)

Local changes:
  libcss/src/stylesheet.h: defines _ALIGNED when it is not defined (upstream's Makefile passes it with -D).

Built by tOS's Makefile (TFIRE_* rules) with -DWITHOUT_ICONV_FILTER -DNDEBUG, for software floating point.
